OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland                      
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy day for Orkney with    
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, heavy at times,     
OL,7,Fespecially in the morning. Shetland    
OL,8,Fwill be cloudy with rain in the        
OL,9,Fmorning but turning drier in the       
OL,10,Fafternoon. Strong southeasterly winds. 
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with rain over Orkney  
OL,13,Fslowly easing in the evening, a few    
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain for Shetland.        
OL,15,FOvernight a light outbreaks of rain    
OL,16,Flingering, but mostly dry. Strong      
OL,17,Fsoutheasterly winds.                   
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
