OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland                      
OL,5,CThursday:FMostly cloudy day but with a 
OL,6,Ffew brighter intervals. The odd light  
OL,7,Foutbreak of rain possible but a        
OL,8,Flargely dry day. Strong southeasterly  
OL,9,Fwinds with gales or severe gales       
OL,10,Fdeveloping.                            
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain and 
OL,13,Fstrong winds, reaching severe gales at 
OL,14,Ftimes, spreading eastwards. Cloudy     
OL,15,Fwith rain and strong winds at times on 
OL,16,FSaturday. Bright spells and showers on 
OL,17,FSunday.                                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
